addaa gammadaan ilillittuu ti.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Ee Waaqa, kolbaan si leellittuu ti;","poem":1},{"text":"kolbaan marti si leellittuu ti.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Latti midhaan baatteerti;","poem":1},{"text":"Waaqi, Waaqayyoon keenna nu hin eebbisa.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Waaqi nu hin eebbisa;","poem":1},{"text":"kolbaan lafa irraa marti isa hin sodaatti.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gax_twf/PSA/67.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gax_twf/PSA/68.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gax_twf/PSA/66.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}